    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/3efd04ab4a6dffae530c146c11ce57a5.svg) ⟨28⟩\nMakinoKF⟨28⟩\n/\npick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset_act-policy-v1⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n Robotics ⟨30⟩ LeRobot ⟨31⟩ Safetensors ⟨32⟩\nMakinoKF/pick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset\n act ⟨33⟩\narxiv: 2304.13705\nLicense: apache-2.0\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨34⟩ Community ⟨35⟩\nDeploy\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this model\n### Instructions to use MakinoKF/pick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset_act-policy-v1 with libraries, inference providers, notebooks, and local apps. Follow these links to get started.\n  * Libraries\n  *  LeRobot⟨36⟩\nHow to use MakinoKF/pick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset_act-policy-v1 with LeRobot:\n  * Notebooks\n  *  Google Colab⟨37⟩\n  *  Kaggle⟨38⟩\n\n\n  * Model Card for act⟨39⟩\n    * How to Get Started with the Model⟨40⟩\n      * Train from scratch⟨41⟩\n      * Evaluate the policy/run inference⟨42⟩\n    * Model Details⟨43⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨39⟩ Model Card for act \nAction Chunking with Transformers (ACT)⟨44⟩ is an imitation-learning method that predicts short action chunks instead of single steps. It learns from teleoperated data and often achieves high success rates.\nThis policy has been trained and pushed to the Hub using LeRobot⟨45⟩. See the full documentation at LeRobot Docs⟨46⟩.\n* * *\n##   ⟨40⟩ How to Get Started with the Model \nFor a complete walkthrough, see the training guide⟨47⟩. Below is the short version on how to train and run inference/eval:\n###   ⟨41⟩ Train from scratch \n\n```\nlerobot-train \\\n  --dataset.repo_id=${HF_USER}/<dataset> \\\n  --policy.type=act \\\n  --output_dir=outputs/train/<desired_policy_repo_id> \\\n  --job_name=lerobot_training \\\n  --policy.device=cuda \\\n  --policy.repo_id=${HF_USER}/<desired_policy_repo_id>\n  --wandb.enable=true\n\n```\n\n_Writes checkpoints to`outputs/train/<desired_policy_repo_id>/checkpoints/`._\n###   ⟨42⟩ Evaluate the policy/run inference \n\n```\nlerobot-record \\\n  --robot.type=so100_follower \\\n  --dataset.repo_id=<hf_user>/eval_<dataset> \\\n  --policy.path=<hf_user>/<desired_policy_repo_id> \\\n  --episodes=10\n\n```\n\nPrefix the dataset repo with **eval_** and supply `--policy.path` pointing to a local or hub checkpoint.\n* * *\n##   ⟨43⟩ Model Details \n  * **License:** apache-2.0\n\n\n\nDownloads last month\n    42\nSafetensors⟨48⟩\nModel size\n51.7M params\nTensor type\nF32 \n·\nFiles info\nVideo Preview\nRobotics\nloading\n##  Dataset used to train MakinoKF/pick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset_act-policy-v1\n#### MakinoKF/pick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset Viewer • Updated 16 days ago • 25.7k • 62 ⟨49⟩\n##  Paper for MakinoKF/pick-bolt-and-place-empty-space-dataset_act-policy-v1\n#### Learning Fine-Grained Bimanual Manipulation with Low-Cost Hardware Paper • 2304.13705 • Published Apr 23, 2023 • 7 ⟨44⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨50⟩ Privacy⟨51⟩ About⟨52⟩ Careers⟨53⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
